<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus Lord, You died</l><l>To set me free.</l><l>Now You’re my all and my everything;</l><l>I am so lost when I’m not near Thee;</l><l>Sick with love for You I’ll ever be,</l><l>Treasured One.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus Lord, I’m charmed</l><l>By Your mercy</l><l>And I rejoice that You’ve chosen me</l><l>To be with You in eternity</l><l>But until then keep me close to Thee,</l><l>Lovely One.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
